  << /ActualText (Home Palette is an AI\055powered interior design and home decoration application that helps users visualize and redesign their living spaces\056 Users can capture photos of any room and use advanced AI to generate realistic redesign suggestions\054 experiment with different furniture arrangements\054 wall colors\054 flooring options\054 and decor styles\056 The app provides house renovation and room remodeling capabilities powered by cutting\055edge artificial intelligence\054 making professional interior design accessible to everyone\056\050\050My Role\050\nFlutter Expert Developer \057 Senior Flutter Developer\nSole Flutter Developer\240\024 Fully designed and built the entire Flutter application from scratch for both iOS and Android\nImplemented AI\055driven room redesign features with image processing and real\055time AI generation\nDeveloped in\055app purchase flows and subscription management for both platforms\nHandled App Store and Google Play submission\054 review processes\054 and ongoing releases\nIntegrated third\055party AI services for interior design generation and photo processing\nOptimized app performance for smooth image handling and AI processing workflows)
