6627 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Project Summary\nToBank is the official digital banking solution of Gardeshgari Bank\054 designed to deliver reliable\054 high\055security financial services for millions of Iranians\056 The platform provides secure card\055to\055card transfers \050Shetab network\051\054 bill payment\054 mobile top\055up\054 internet packages\054 vehicle fines payment\054 charity donations\054 travel insurance\054 and advanced digital wallet features\056 With a focus on performance\054 security\054 and privacy\054 ToBank ensures compliance with banking standards and provides a seamless multi\055platform experience on Android\054 iOS\054 and Web\056\050\050My Role\050\nFlutter Expert Developer \057 Senior Flutter Developer\nLed Flutter development for financial and security\055critical modules in an enterprise\055grade banking app\056\nDesigned\054 implemented\054 and maintained secure payment workflows including wallet\054 Shetab transfers\054 and bill pay\056\nDeveloped strong authentication flows\072 OTP\054 biometric login\054 session\057device security\054 encrypted data storage\056\nCollaborated closely with backend\057DevOps to strengthen anti\055fraud features and ensure regulatory compliance\056\nBuilt and maintained automated unit\054 integration\054 and widget tests with special focus on financial logic and security\056\nConducted regular code reviews and system audits for compliance and security best practices\056)
     /K [ 400 ]
     /P 6628 0 R
     /Pg 6227 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
