  << /ActualText (Hamkelasi Smart Super App \072 \nis a comprehensive and integrated application for managing schools and educational institutions\056 With it\054 you can oversee all aspects of your organization\041\050Hamkelasi School Application\nFor Students\072 Students can easily participate in online classes or exams\054 review and submit their homework to their teacher\054 and also reserve food or request books from the library through the student app\056\nFor Parents\072 One of the main advantages of the school application for parents is the ability to quickly communicate with school staff and monitor their children\047s academic and disciplinary status\056 Parents can also track their children\047s report cards and performance\056\nFor Teachers\072 The Hamkelasi app allows teachers to review and record information in the class register\054 upload and receive assignments\054 record academic and disciplinary matters\054 and even communicate with students or parents\056\nFor Administrative Staff\072 The principal and administrative staff can use the mobile app to review and oversee ongoing school activities\056 They can view students\047 academic performance and status through analytical charts and record various disciplinary issues in the system\056\nFeatures\072\nAvailable for various operating systems \050Android \054 PWA and iOS\051\056\nProvides different access levels for school staff\054 parents\054 and students\056\nIncludes a notification system and internal messaging management without additional costs\056\nAllows for electronic assignment submission and review\054 as well as offline class register access for teachers\056\nEasy to use with a user\055friendly and aesthetically pleasing graphical interface to enhance educational services and smarten schools\056\nFacilitates effective communication between users and school contacts\054 improving oversight and recording of disciplinary issues\056\nCompatibility\072 The Hamkelasi school application is available for Android and iOS and is compatible with a wide range of mobile devices and tablets\056\nFree Messaging System\072 The internal messaging management feature in the Hamkelasi school application allows free communication with school members\056\nAccess Level Management\072 All users have access to specific sections of the app based on their role within the system and can oversee those sections\056)
